{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slime Store Simulator is a small casual game where you operate a store that sells cute slimes! Order a variety of different types of slimes, set your own prices, take payments, hire help, and expand the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy Slimes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock up on lots of different slimes. The slimes vary in color, size, shape, price, and some even come with accessories.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-06_115135.png?t=1744221440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Store Slimes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place the slimes on the shelf and set your own price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/Slimes_in_game.png?t=1744221440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell Slimes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with different customers and sell your slimes at the register. The slime store accepts cash and credit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-06_114929.png?t=1744221440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand Your Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you sell more slimes you will level up and make more money which will allow you to expand the store, hire a cashier, and buy even more slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-06_114827.png?t=1744221440\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637520?t=1744221440","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/image